    "title": "refactor: extract try_get_adt_def helper to consolidate duplicated ADT validation logic",
    "body": "Closes #192 — extracted duplicated ADT validation logic into a shared `try_get_adt_def` helper.\n\n## Changes\n- Added `try_get_adt_def` helper function that extracts an `AdtDef` from a receiver expression's type, peeling references first\n- Added `ty_adt_def` helper for raw `Ty` extraction (used by `is_bytes_type`)\n- Replaced 9 duplicated ADT-type-resolution blocks across all 8 lint implementations\n- Fixed a regression in `RedundantEnvClone` where the original `receiver_ty` was still needed for `peel_and_count_ty_refs`",
